@NelsonsDev, thanks very much for the follow-up.

It sounds like the specific problem named by OP in this issue is fixed by #2017, but your comment notes a new/different problem? (Or, a similar problem with a different server configuration/SSH daemon?)

If so, please repost your comment as a new issue and we'll close this one. Best to keep the scope of these issues granular and separated, since the fixes are different.
